  "notes": [
    "Ahorita means \"in a little while\" in Colombia, not always \"right now\".",
    "De pronto (\"suddenly\") means \"maybe\" in Colombia: De pronto es del profesor.",
    "Mío / mía agrees with the thing, not the owner: el bolso es mío, la maleta es mía.",
    "Esfero is Colombian for a pen. ¿Me presta un esfero? (\"will you lend me a pen?\") is how most people ask."
  ]
